  "boundaries": [
    "Stages overlap and are not summed. Pure scaffold probes are distinct from compiler-backed source acceptance and actual execution.",
    "The reference app moduleFeatureCompatibility/openModuleFunctionImport and functionBlueprintCallingFeature compare input/output count/type/order and construct one reference with positional wiring. This implementation retains the existing single-return primitive/array ABI and sync-acyclic-v1.",
    "Candidate lists are manifest/owned identity pages, explicitly marked read-current-contract. A selected candidate is accepted only after its current declared signature matches. Self import is refused to avoid accidental same-context recursion. Same-function parent implementation reuse is already available by inheritance without a new child graph.",
    "The original owned/registered blank-body APIs remain. Reference mode observes owner and root manifest plus any owned target/donor declarations, and separately checks current registered function/manifest receipts. External manifests are counted once for the same namespace/hash. This is not a filesystem-wide atomic snapshot.",
    "Whole import creates only implementation and graph. Object provide and registration changes join them as four mandatory Review/Confirm sources. It creates no C# node file, copies no donor body and grants no code-node Task capability. Original functions, defaults, parents, modules and C# stay byte exact.",
    "Input values mode/reference/catalog/query/page/name are whitelisted at both capture and restore. Revision/hash/basis/contract tokens are not restored as authority. Full current form and source checks precede explicit creation.",
    "All runtime calls use owned local fixtures. Counter files prove no donor execution during prepare/create/Save/cold/compiler Confirm and exactly one donor call per explicit runtime invocation.",
    "No new implicit-end/type semantics are inferred. The unanswered missing-output termination choice remains separate. Native/device execution, real accounts, paid models, user PC installation, main/original ZIP/Android settings changes are outside these claims."
  ],
